title Cassette: RENAME opens the toolkit text box for the take prefix (keyboard policy: no keyboard connected here, so the toolkit fallback keyboard shows); Esc closes it
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle

wait 500
key l
wait 300
tap "RENAME"
wait 500
expect text "Name"
expect osk on
shot rename
key esc
wait 300
expect osk off
expect text "RENAME"
say Esc closed the text box; the list is back
expect noquit
